invariant: INV-33
file: webpki_pin.c
catches: webpki_auth_test
reason: webpki_path_pinned hashes the first configured anchor instead of
  the one at anchor_index, so a pin on an anchor that named the issuer
  and verified nothing passes, and a pin on the anchor that verified is
  refused. bin/webpki_auth_test's r2 chain under the impostor anchor then
  the real root objects.

--- old
    const ch_trust_anchor *anchor = &cfg->anchors[leaf->anchor_index];
--- new
    const ch_trust_anchor *anchor = &cfg->anchors[0];
